            <h2 class="reveal">SmolVLM Pipeline: Image Splitting → Pixel Shuffle → SmolLM2</h2>

            <div class="arch-pipeline reveal-scale" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
                <div class="arch-stage">
                    <div class="arch-stage-icon">🖼️</div>
