            <p class="arch-note reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.35s;">Three critical design findings drive compact VLM performance: <strong style="color:var(--accent-teal)">balanced compute</strong>, <strong style="color:var(--accent-blue)">token compression</strong>, and <strong style="color:var(--accent-purple)">extended context</strong></p>
        </div>
        <span class="slide-number">03 / 09</span>
    </section>

